N 50° 58.311 W 113° 54.730&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[FOUND] on a lovely bike ride out on the canal with hunthikers, BTDT and ChubLaw.  The cap has been hacked up badly!  TFTcap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
